abstract: "Analysis scripts, pre-specified protocol with SHA-256 fingerprints, results and saved openFDA responses for an exploratory study of co-expression networks in INS-1 cells after Notch (DAPT) and Wnt (DKK-1) inhibition and of a network-based drug-pair ranking. Exploratory and computational; no prediction of toxicity, efficacy or synergy."
